2012-10-17  Jyri J. Virkki  <jyri@virkki.com>

        * version 0.2

            No functionality changes.

            Some refactoring of build rules and defines to remove some of
            the platform ifdef complexity.

            Included build scripts to help generate sbc tree, a pre-requisite
